  "description": "Roslyn source generator emitting a static Schema and reflection-free Materialize method on classes marked with [ScrapeSchema]. Pairs with WebReaper.Extraction.Attributes. The .NET-native structural differentiator (REPOSITIONING-PLAN §2.3) — Pydantic-parity that Python cannot match.",
